WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:01,670
Just do what Wang Sheng said

2
00:00:01,670 --> 00:00:03,640
Whoever works hard will have food to eat

3
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:05,320
Don't want to give anything

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,000
Then just wait for death.

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,120
That's right

6
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:11,340
I'm robbing, I tell you that's it

7
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:17,920
Don’t think that us women are easy to bully

8
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,040
We women can hold up for half a day, right?

9
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,960
Don't even look at what you look like

10
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,040
She looks ugly but sounds beautiful

11
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:25,320
brothers

12
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:27,520
Those who refute these

13
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,240
banished outside

14
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:38,040
So as not to waste food, come here carefully

15
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:49,750
I won't eat, okay?

16
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:50,870
please

17
00:00:50,870 --> 00:00:56,580
Things have developed like this

18
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,940
in my plan

19
00:00:57,940 --> 00:00:59,730
Waiting for the escort team to be formed

20
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:02,250
You can threaten Lingli and hand over the food.

21
00:01:02,250 --> 00:01:03,970
This can also save my wife
